{
  "format": "kshader",
  "generator": "Kekenik Shader",
  "graph": {
    "comments": [
      {
        "color": "#60a5fa",
        "id": "note_inputs",
        "position": {
          "x": 22,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 1374
        },
        "text": "UV (u across, v from stem to tip), object-space position for the wind and time."
      },
      {
        "color": "#4ade80",
        "id": "note_shape",
        "position": {
          "x": 1600,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2072
        },
        "text": "`halfWidth(v) = width × sin(πv)^0.6` gives a pointed oval. Alpha is 1 inside `|u − ½| < halfWidth` with a hair of anti-aliasing; the Alpha Clip threshold cuts the card to the leaf."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fbbf24",
        "id": "note_veins",
        "position": {
          "x": 1600,
          "y": 537
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2684
        },
        "text": "Midrib: `1 − smoothstep(0, 0.03, |u − ½|)`. Side veins: `fract(v·count − |u − ½|·3)` is a sawtooth along diagonal lines; its distance from ½ peaks on a thin line, fading towards the leaf edge."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fb923c",
        "id": "note_color",
        "position": {
          "x": 4488,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 848
        },
        "text": "Colour runs from *Base* to *Tip* along v; veins are blended in with `lerp(colour, vein colour, vein × 0.7)`."
      },
      {
        "color": "#f472b6",
        "id": "note_trans",
        "position": {
          "x": 4488,
          "y": 665
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 848
        },
        "text": "Translucency colour × strength feeds the master's **Translucency** block; **Thickness** = blade thickness + 0.5 × vein, so veins block more light (they look dark against the sun)."
      },
      {
        "color": "#22d3ee",
        "id": "note_wind",
        "position": {
          "x": 5540,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 73,
          "w": 542
        },
        "text": "**Wind Foliage** bends the card with a mask of `v` (0 at the stem = pinned, 1 at the tip = free): one slow sway along the wind direction plus phase-shifted flutter driven by the object position."
      },
      {
        "color": "#a78bfa",
        "id": "note_out",
        "position": {
          "x": 6286,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 542
        },
        "text": "Alpha Clip, Render Face = Both and double-sided normals are set in the graph settings."
      }
    ],
